A new feature `xray` (Demos, first in the sidebar): https://web-summit.sgit.ai/people/silvio/app/index.html#xray
in a full-screen window over the app (no chrome), system bars hidden and coming back hidden after a swipe,
FLAG_KEEP_SCREEN_ON while shown, Back does nothing. Pages only on web-summit.sgit.ai (others ignored, never
handed to a browser); sub-resources only from the hosts the page uses (XrayPolicy.SUBRESOURCE_HOSTS).
