45 s stall, at once when the network returns, a new WebView if the renderer dies. Staff leave by holding the
bottom-start corner for 3 s, then Leave / Reload page / Stay. DOM storage on and kept, first-party cookies
kept, in its own WebView profile where supported (WebView 110+), so the site screen's data wipe never
clears the page's demo key. Holds the idle reset off. Not on the stand-mode visitor list (fail closed): the
page can call openrouter.ai with a key typed on the device; that is security.android's call.

Host lines: FEATURES (+XrayFeature), sectionOf/NAV_ORDER/iconFor in MainActivity, feature_xray_title in
features.xml, and the xray start URL in FeatureLinksTest's reviewed origin map: for review by the owners.
